/target
/bin
**/target
**/*.log
**/*.pem
**/*.eif
# Wallet / key material must never be tracked. Gate:
# secure-sign-core/tests/no_tracked_wallet_files.rs (runs in `cargo test --workspace`).
#
# Provenance: secure-sign/config/nep6_wallet.json WAS tracked here — a NEP-6
# wallet with 2 accounts and scrypt n=64, r=2, p=2 (NEP-2 default is
# n=16384, r=8, p=8, roughly 256x stronger). Untracked on 2026-09-23 and kept
# on disk as local config only. History is the owner's to rewrite; these
# patterns stop the next one.
**/*.neopkg
**/*.nep6.json
**/nep6_wallet.json
**/nep6-wallet.json
**/nep6wallet.json
**/*keystore*
**/*.keystore
**/*.p12
**/*.pfx
**/*.jks
**/UTC--*
**/wallet-config.yml
.vscode/
.idea/
**/.DS_Store
**/venv/
secure-sign-sgx-enclave/*.py

# Cross-compilation toolchain config. It names an absolute linker path on the
# machine that generated it, so committing it would break every other checkout.
/.cargo/

# CodeGraph index: local per machine. The directory carries its own ignore file.
